# Local databases
db/*.db
db/*.db-journal
db/*.sqlite
db/*.sqlite-journal
db/*.db-wal
db/*.db-shm
# Exception: the launch corpus DB IS the build input — CF Pages SSG reads it
# via getStaticPaths during `astro build`. Without this exception, CF Pages
# clones an empty db/ and the build fails with "unable to open database file".
# The data is public anyway (CC-BY-SA, planned Zenodo deposit), and no PII
# lives here (subscribers go to the separate sohamhamso-pii Turso DB).
!db/sohamhamso.db

# Local dev caches
.turso/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache

